f the variables your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutationFn"},{"type":"text","value":" accepts."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tonmutateresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOnMutateResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutate"},{"type":"text","value":", passed on to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSuccess"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onError"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSettled"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tvariables","text":"TVariables","level":3},{"id":"tonmutateresult","text":"TOnMutateResult","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UseMutationOptions<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = Accessor<MutationOptions<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/types.ts:258](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/types.ts#L258)\n\nThe accessor `useMutation` expects as its first argument — Solid re-evaluates it reactively, so callbacks\nand other options can depend on signals.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your `mutationFn` resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `mutationFn` may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\nThe type of the variables your `mutationFn` accepts.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed on to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UseMutationOptions\ntitle: UseMutationOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UseMutationOptions<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> = Accessor<MutationOptions<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/types.ts:258](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/types.ts#L258)\n\nThe accessor `useMutation` expects as its first argument — Solid re-evaluates it reactively, so callbacks\nand other options can depend on signals.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your `mutationFn` resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `mutationFn` may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `void`\n\nThe type of the variables your `mutationFn` accepts.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed on to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled`.\n"}
